                        ],
                        "form": "putassiers"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "19b9babc-867d-433d-839b-8fc4507544c1",
                        "entry_id": "cc6df7c7-5330-32ea-b6c5-a0b88f0a81aa",
                        "tags": [
                            "singular",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "putassière"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "1206155e-f2aa-4209-b1df-3aa3a18f1a6a",
                        "entry_id": "cc6df7c7-5330-32ea-b6c5-a0b88f0a81aa",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "putassières"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ef9a1e01-dcc8-367e-b2cf-616fc082ef77",
                        "entry_id": "cc6df7c7-5330-32ea-b6c5-a0b88f0a81aa",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui se comporte comme une prostituée, relatif aux prostituées."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "vulgar"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "22d27408-6e5f-4657-ad87-2b08ab3035af",
                                "sense_id": "ef9a1e01-dcc8-367e-b2cf-616fc082ef77",
                                "text": "Au cours de ses orgies César, qui précède le Marquis de Sade dans ses délires surréalistes, a certainement besoin des services compétents de la gent putassière."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2e523f5d-4e7d-4ea3-bcc7-ea64cfa7da97",
                                "sense_id": "ef9a1e01-dcc8-367e-b2cf-616fc082ef77",
                                "text": "Putassière, Marianne épaulait des rois nègres qui acceptaient de brader leur pétrole ou leurs métaux rares contre des armes et des comptes en Suisse."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a429c04e-9a77-3950-9537-25559fe9ec18",
                        "entry_id": "cc6df7c7-5330-32ea-b6c5-a0b88f0a81aa",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Racoleur."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "vulgar"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "016035f2-0fdd-4bb6-9c4a-dabab21a744c",
                                "sense_id": "a429c04e-9a77-3950-9537-25559fe9ec18",
                                "text": "Certes, j'ai pris la précaution, torture, de ne pas m'arrêter devant le km de rayon charcuterie, saucissons affriolants, jambons crus carrément putassiers qui hument malgré le froid."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9322ee75-966e-4d3f-8897-9a06866e159b",
                                "sense_id": "a429c04e-9a77-3950-9537-25559fe9ec18",
                                "text": "Pour faire bonne mesure, le Sunday Times consacre un article aux Pretty Things, aussi putassier et stupide qu'on peut l'imaginer."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d6fc1b87-9fb7-3af8-98c3-4650072ff1db",
                        "entry_id": "cc6df7c7-5330-32ea-b6c5-a0b88f0a81aa",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Vendu, prostitué à des intérêts."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "vulgar"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "00ccca1f-2403-40cc-8cbf-ddf7a2dce5c3",
                                "sense_id": "d6fc1b87-9fb7-3af8-98c3-4650072ff1db",
                                "text": "Sales républicains de pacotille, infâmes richards, journaleux putassiers, vous tous qui rongez le populo plus que la vermine et l'abrutissez avec vos mensonges"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "13ca0826-9cab-38c2-83d5-f231fd1f2c20",
                        "entry_id": "cc6df7c7-5330-32ea-b6c5-a0b88f0a81aa",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Cabotin."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "vulgar"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ea250a64-cf92-47a8-b18c-40caf291456d",
                                "sense_id": "13ca0826-9cab-38c2-83d5-f231fd1f2c20",
                                "text": "[…] ; ça n'était pas un défaut, plutôt une qualité ; dans ce milieu de l'info où journaliste et interviewé font semblant de se dévêtir mutuellement au cours de la plus putassière des exhibitions publiques, c'était qu'on le sentit interchangeable qui le rendait unique."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c1ba24ea-2ebf-442b-b726-abef623d312a",
                        "source_entry_id": "cc6df7c7-5330-32ea-b6c5-a0b88f0a81aa",
                        "target_lang_word": "whorish",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "whorish",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dbebb4b4-8505-383f-aff6-bf31f687fa96",
                                        "entry_id": "83a7a622-8b4e-3cbd-b999-2c038f4b96d5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Resembling or befitting a whore."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "vulgar"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c8637efc-6c60-4434-a436-ac1d73c932e8",
                                                "sense_id": "dbebb4b4-8505-383f-aff6-bf31f687fa96",
                                                "text": "Some pop singers try to compensate for lack of talent with whorish outfits and gyrations."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "544592da-347a-451a-9ae8-f195873e183e",
                                                "sense_id": "dbebb4b4-8505-383f-aff6-bf31f687fa96",
                                                "text": "You, like a lecher, out of whorish loins / Are pleased to breed out your inheritors:"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d4a9c221-0457-4194-998a-b29431d07f47",
                                                "sense_id": "dbebb4b4-8505-383f-aff6-bf31f687fa96",
                                                "text": "[…] I am broken with their whorish heart which hath departed from me, and with their eyes which goe a whoring after their idoles: […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "19547333-b075-43a4-a8ea-b2299fc9a8a3",
                                                "sense_id": "dbebb4b4-8505-383f-aff6-bf31f687fa96",
                                                "text": "[…] Lish’s mother, the divorcee, was a beauty and a whorish flirt."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6a39ffcf-0949-4fc5-b182-539b753ada3f",
                                                "sense_id": "dbebb4b4-8505-383f-aff6-bf31f687fa96",
                                                "text": "Vince, a natty 23-year-old financial analyst from Hoboken, made no bones about his agenda. \"I love it here, it's so whorish,\" he said."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c2692304-e83f-4776-a774-242a8d83870b",
                        "source_entry_id": "cc6df7c7-5330-32ea-b6c5-a0b88f0a81aa",
                        "target_lang_word": "sluttish",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "sluttish",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fd8ea1a2-a606-3490-aae9-e91798e0c152",
                                        "entry_id": "ef74df59-9d20-3562-8541-4094c45b42fd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Like a slut; sexually promiscuous."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "vulgar"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "92f710ef-97dc-4b17-982a-fd6f48b3ccec",
                                                "sense_id": "fd8ea1a2-a606-3490-aae9-e91798e0c152",
                                                "text": "His name was perhaps the least likely ever to have been young: it evoked for me the sunless complexion, unaired suiting, steel-rimmed glasses of a ledger clerk in a vanished age. Or had done so, before I found my beautiful, cocky, sluttish Arthur—an Arthur it was impossible to imagine old."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9a777fd3-b3de-3f54-a0de-6ede7412c2a1",
                                        "entry_id": "ef74df59-9d20-3562-8541-4094c45b42fd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Dirty or untidy; disorderly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f261edc1-64fc-4109-a1b5-1abdb14721d1",
                                                "sense_id": "9a777fd3-b3de-3f54-a0de-6ede7412c2a1",
                                                "text": "[…] an air of liberal, though sluttish, plenty, indicated the wealthy farmer."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d36f279a-9692-481a-a0d6-b4a0fe01222f",
                                                "sense_id": "9a777fd3-b3de-3f54-a0de-6ede7412c2a1",
                                                "text": "[…] and it was dark and sluttish as all Burmese rooms are, though U Po Kyin had furnished it 'Ingaleik fashion' with a veneered sideboard and chairs […]\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a78996f2-6f76-4fdf-9f97-424c0a981ed2",
                                                "sense_id": "9a777fd3-b3de-3f54-a0de-6ede7412c2a1",
                                                "text": "\"Check plates and cutlery for tell-tale signs of sluttish washing up […]\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "67f6af3d-9071-407a-b684-91dc03f103f0",
                        "source_entry_id": "cc6df7c7-5330-32ea-b6c5-a0b88f0a81aa",
